//! that difference is the reading.
//!
//! The tokens (classic discriminants): 0 VINIT reset, 1 TANCH emit, 2 AFWD
//! advance a, 3 AREV root of the gap, 4 CLINK form the pair (a-b,a+b), 5 IMSCRIB
